{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/628320-help-me-figure-out-what-to-play","id":628320,"title":"Help me figure out what to play!","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Additional Discussion","Off-Topic"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-08-16T00:58:13-07:00","id":628320,"title":"Help me figure out what to play!","content":"Its been almost a year since I last roleplayed and we badly want to start up a solo game again. Problem is we can't figure out what to play, we have ruled out anything world of darkness. Considered exalted, made said exalted then decided that game required to much focus. Made a shadowrun character, but though we had fun making it and designing NPCs back story etc it seems we don't want to play it.<br /> <br /> We need a game that's not going to require extreme attention, a two month old likes to interrupt far to much to make deep thought and immersion possible. I'm thinking a d20 game would be good as we can switch between role playing and roll playing as needed. I just don't know what d20 game. Throw some ideas out at me people anything,serious,fun,fantasy,SciFi I just want ideas. Would love some honest reviews of the suggestions if you've played them I always prefer games where word of mouth was good <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:lucida sans unicode\"><span style=\"color:#ee82ee\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><b><i><u>Follow me on twitter! <a href=\"https://twitter.com/scelestai\" target=\"_blank\">https://twitter.com/scelestai</a></u></i></b></span></span></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/897-scelesta","name":"Scelesta","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar897_2.j